{
    "code": "/// Setup\ntileType(1, 1);   // AIR \ntileType(3, 3);   // EARTH\ntileType(4, 4);   // ROCK\nfor (int y = 0; y < height; y++) { for (int x = 0; x < width; x++) { result[y][x] = 1; } }\n\n/// Earth\nfor (int y = 0; y < height; y++) { for (int x = 0; x < width; x++) {\nint n = noise(x, y) * 10;\nif (y > n + 0) { result[y][x] = 3; }\n} }\n\n/// Rock\nfor (int y = 0; y < height; y++) { for (int x = 0; x < width; x++) {\nint n = noise(x, y) * 27;\nif (y > n + 6) { result[y][x] = 4; }\n} }\n\n/// Burrow\nburrow();\n/// Grass\nsurface(3, 2);\n/// Ore\nore();\n/// Dungeon（120 x 40 以上）\ndungeon();",
